WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.080
- [LA] This is Sound Field.

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.120
I'm LA Buckner, a drummer and educator

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.970
from the north side of Minneapolis.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:08.600
I learned my skills through
the Black gospel church.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.433
- [Nahre] I'm Nahre Sol.

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:11.750
I'm a Julliard-trained
pianist and composer,

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.470
and I perform in concert
halls all over the world.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.470
- [LA] Together, we are
discovering the answers

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.980
to all kinds of musical questions.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.560
- [Nahre] What makes James
Brown sound like James Brown?

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.480
- [LA] What makea a sad song sad?

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.240
- [Nahre] Is Nicki Minaj
just Jay-Z slowed down?

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.962
- [LA] Find out on Sound Field.

00:00:27.962 --> 00:00:32.045
(ambient electronic synth music)

